{"id":"m4-201","m":4,"paper":"2019年河北省公务员录用考试《行测》题（县级+乡镇）（网友回忆版）","region":"河北","year":2019,"q":15,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2388034","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"三个自然数分别是一位数、两位数和三位数，其积为3930，其和最小为多少？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"144"},{"k":"B","t":"146"},{"k":"C","t":"148"},{"k":"D","t":"162"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>将3930进行因数分解可得，3930=1×2×3×5×131，组成的一位数、两位数和三位数情况有五种：（2、15、131），（3、10、131），（1、30、131），（1、10、393），（1、15、262）。三者加和最小的情况为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5f1365088866b3e7.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2388042","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>将300克浓度<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9eacc4b81b90d57f.png\" />的酒精与若干浓度<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d43716cf36224da5.png\" />的酒精，混合成浓度<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b2b88d60243eb1bd.png\" />的酒精，需要浓度<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d43716cf36224da5.png\" />的酒精多少克？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"225"},{"k":"B","t":"240"},{"k":"C","t":"380"},{"k":"D","t":"400"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：设需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />克浓度60%的酒精，根据混合前后溶质总量不变，可列方程<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9c90abbe562cafe7.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c42e3f074f63462.png\" />。</p><p>方法二： 设需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />克浓度<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d43716cf36224da5.png\" />的酒精，根据线段法口诀“距离（浓度差）与量（溶液质量）成反比”得，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-64c82914124c2669.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1e4cb7b68a186d63.png\" />。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16acfc5b8ad20e5.png\" /></p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2388044","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲、乙、丙三人均每隔一定时间去一次健身房锻炼。甲每隔2天去一次，乙每隔4天去一次，丙每7天去一次。4月10日三人相遇，下一次相遇是哪天？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"5月28日"},{"k":"B","t":"6月5日"},{"k":"C","t":"7月24日"},{"k":"D","t":"7月25日"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>甲每隔2天去一次，即每3天去一次；乙每隔4天去一次，即每5天去一次；丙每7天去一次。三人周期的最小公倍数为105天，即每过105天三人再相遇一次。4月10日三人相遇，再过105天下一次相遇，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3b1c6146d1dd89ab.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-dca6c05d1316a7ec.png\" />，即7月24日三人相遇。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2388047","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"集贸市场销售苹果5元/个和火龙果3元/个，花光61元最多可购买这两种水果共多少个？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"13"},{"k":"B","t":"16"},{"k":"C","t":"18"},{"k":"D","t":"19"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设买<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />个苹果，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />个火龙果，则由题意可得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cb2bcd5c8a874fe9.png\" />。总钱数固定，若想买到水果个数最多，则尽可能多买便宜的水果，即让<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />尽可能大，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />尽可能小。</p><p>当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6e10396444bf3306.png\" />时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />不为整数，排除；</p><p>当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2d46c0c2d0358868.png\" />时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d321b44fcd9f897f.png\" />，满足。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-eadfadb6b7dd0aff.png\" />最大值为19。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2388050","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"小贾骑行从起点出发向东骑行3公里后，折向南骑行7公里，又向东骑行5公里后，再向北骑行1公里。现在，小贾距离起点的直线距离是多少公里?","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"6"},{"k":"B","t":"8"},{"k":"C","t":"10"},{"k":"D","t":"16"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>如图AE为起点与终点之间的直线距离，直角三角形AEF中<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9f0ee24b5a30873c.png\" />公里，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-91c82b468cfc79c9.png\" />公里，则根据勾股定理<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2e266c937d33a2a0.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6a8db00aa4dc53b1.png\" />公里</p><p>故正确答案为C 。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16acfcbe7ff8489.png\" /></p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2388057","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲、乙两队单独完成某项工程分别需要10天、17天。甲队与乙队按天轮流做这项工程，甲队先做，最后是哪队第几天完工？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"甲队第11天"},{"k":"B","t":"甲队第13天"},{"k":"C","t":"乙队第12天"},{"k":"D","t":"乙队第14天"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，假设工程总量为17与10的最小公倍数170，则甲队每天干的量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5063ce2f5e2d904f.png\" />；乙队每天干的量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-11b3c31bbdcd2fea.png\" />，每两天完成的量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ed4a25c304a3ae83.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fe26d8f813bcc955.png\" />，即经过<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8554495c798b2952.png\" />天后，剩余工程量为8，由甲去完成。故最后是甲队第13天完工。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2388058","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某新建高速公路中间隔离带绿化时，顺次种植2株蜀桧、3株刺柏、5株小叶女贞、3株大叶黄杨，按此循环，第2019株树木是什么？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"蜀桧"},{"k":"B","t":"刺柏"},{"k":"C","t":"小叶女贞"},{"k":"D","t":"大叶黄杨"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，种植的周期数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5621c8221d71b875.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a9c605c0ea920572.png\" />，即经过155个周期后，剩余4株，这4株中前2株为蜀桧，后2株为刺柏，故第2019株树木是刺柏。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"2388060","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某班参加学科竞赛人数40人，其中参加数学竞赛的有22人，参加物理竞赛的有27人，参加化学竞赛的有25人，只参加两科竞赛的有24人，参加三科竞赛的有多少人？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"2"},{"k":"B","t":"3"},{"k":"C","t":"5"},{"k":"D","t":"7"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设参加三科竞赛的人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，参加学科竞赛人数为40人，则40人当中都不参加的为0人。根据三集合非标准型公式：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5e6ee581d954ea0a.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5d92a51f494c4391.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-533ef5911bf62679.png\" />，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3615c82a99e1e862.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7166c711f4ac1371.png\" />，故参加三科竞赛的有5人。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"2388061","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>小赵从家出发去单位上班要经过多条街道（如右图），假如他只能向西或向南行走，则他上班有多少种不同的走法？</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16acfa43cdb6ae9.png\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"6"},{"k":"B","t":"24"},{"k":"C","t":"32"},{"k":"D","t":"35"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：小赵从家到单位只能向西或向南（在图中向左或向下走），可依据标1法解题，如图所示：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16acf8c93e95112.png\" /></p><p>因此一共有35种方法可选择。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p><p>方法二：小赵从家到单位必然要经历7条街道，由于只能向西或向南（在图中向左或向下走），所以向西（向左）需要走4条街道，向南（向下）走3条街道，只要在7条街道中选择3条向南走即可，方法数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4ff66ebb8f8abedc.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":10,"qid":"2388063","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲乙二人沿环形跑道从同一地点同时背向开始跑步，35秒后两人相遇。已知甲跑一圈需要60秒，乙跑一圈需要多少秒？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"77"},{"k":"B","t":"84"},{"k":"C","t":"91"},{"k":"D","t":"96"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设甲的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-09e00b6a12b4601d.png\" />，乙的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0419425ce75ef58b.png\" />，可得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bc6e61e43b3a36f7.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a30dd2affaf13da8.png\" />，若甲乙分别单独跑一圈，路程相同，时间与速度成反比，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c81952c240d6a9bf.png\" />，所以<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3c2271c59a43467f.png\" />秒。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":11,"qid":"2388116","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某单位需要搬家，可以使用甲、乙、丙三个搬家公司。单独完成该搬家任务，甲需要3天，乙需要4天，丙需要12天；搬家费用分别为甲1000元/天，乙850元/天，丙350元/天。要求在2天内搬完，最少需要花费多少元？（搬家不足一天按一天计算）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3200"},{"k":"B","t":"3400"},{"k":"C","t":"3550"},{"k":"D","t":"3700"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1710a5dfdb6126f.png\" /></p><p>根据上表分析可得，甲单独完成任务所花费的钱数最少。赋值搬家的工作总量为12份，则甲平均完成每份工作量的花费也最少，故应尽可能多用甲，其次为乙和丙。</p><p>根据题干条件计算，甲、乙、丙每天可完成的工作量应分别为4份、3份、1份。尽可能多用甲，则两天均用共完成8份任务，剩余4份由乙和丙各工作一天刚好完成。故总花费<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3e9849155094aa85.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-755df3e57c67c7c9.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":12,"qid":"2388117","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>某次考试小明全对的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b08870e307ffeee4.png\" />，小宁全对的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6df5552bc0be517b.png\" />，那么这次考试只有一人全对的概率为多少？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"0.24"},{"k":"B","t":"0.38"},{"k":"C","t":"0.56"},{"k":"D","t":"0.94"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>只有一人全对，即要么小明全对，要么小宁全对。可分为两种情况：</p><p>（1）小明全对，小宁未全对。其概率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cd6e63b964485d2b.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-456176a07580c99f.png\" />；</p><p>（2）小宁全对，小明未全对。其概率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-92914c64935c5298.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c5918444b76b3aca.png\" />；</p><p>则只有一人全对的概率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-01f707bcb32c4c11.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":13,"qid":"2388121","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"一个暗箱装有12个编号从1到12的乒乓球，甲、乙、丙三人轮流从暗箱中摸球，每人每次摸一个球且不放回。将所有球摸完后，三人所摸出的球上的编号之和相等，并且甲摸出了1号球和3号球，乙摸出了6号球和11号球。丙摸出的球编号最大为多少？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"7"},{"k":"B","t":"8"},{"k":"C","t":"9"},{"k":"D","t":"10"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>球的编号为1-12，根据等差数列求和公式可得，球的编号总和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2bb9bec49ddd8577.png\" />。因“所有球摸完后，三人所摸出的球上的编号之和相等”，则平均每人的编号之和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6d78b11cfcdd0805.png\" />。12个球，三人去摸，平均每人摸4个。其中：甲摸出了1号和3号，剩余两球编号之和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-41a7aabb9debd0bf.png\" />，只能为10号和12号；乙摸出了6号和11号，剩余两球编号之和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fd0354021d84a499.png\" />，故乙摸出剩余两球中的最大编号不能为9。</p><p>综上，甲必然摸走12号和10号，乙摸出11号且一定摸不出9号，故丙摸出的球编号最大应为9号。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":14,"qid":"2388124","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"将1000个边长为1cm的小正方体组合成一个实心的大正方体后，将该正方体的5个面涂满色后再全部分开，那么至少有一面涂色的小正方体有多少个？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"424"},{"k":"B","t":"488"},{"k":"C","t":"512"},{"k":"D","t":"576"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题干将1000个边长为1cm的小正方体组合成一个实心的大正方体，设大正方体的棱长为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62003cd76f2a6cb0.png\" />，根据体积不变列式<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-865926842dc084e9.png\" />，可知大正方体的棱长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62003cd76f2a6cb0.png\" />为10。结合题意将大正方体5个面涂色，如下图所示（右侧未涂色，其余面均涂色）：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16acfbc454a6eec.png\" /></p><p>可知有涂色的正方体分为三种情况：</p><p>①顶点正方体（图中黑色部分），位于大正方体顶点位置，每个顶点各对应一个，一共有8个；</p><p>②棱正方体（图中黄色部分），位于大正方体棱上，每条棱上8个，12条棱一共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-dd7db7ab3c62a34e.png\" />个；</p><p>③面正方体（图中蓝色部分），位于大正方体每个面的面上，大正方体每个面上有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-41b19fd6f21eed58.png\" />个面正方体，五个面涂色一共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ca0c805e72ba0fdb.png\" />个。</p><p>则题目所求至少有一面涂色的小正方体共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-caf4d950564fc0a1.png\" />个。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":15,"qid":"2388127","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>长、宽、高分别为12cm、4cm、3cm的长方体<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d1966f3f409b5857.png\" />上，有一个蚂蚁从A出发沿长方体表面爬行到<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d9b53ba091283164.png\" />获取食物，其路程最小值是多少cm？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0b802f3b9665f9f8.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a91ad5a7f2972aa9.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-53d7de16a0495dbe.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fdd1d570f3816298.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题干蚂蚁从A出发沿长方体表面爬行到<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d9b53ba091283164.png\" /> 求<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4b13a2af6e6ca7be.png\" /> 最短，画图可知，在长方体中A和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d9b53ba091283164.png\" />不在同一平面，要求最短距离先要把A和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d9b53ba091283164.png\" /> 放在同一平面内，则把面<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2768828649633f5a.png\" />翻折，形成面<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a128408e528be0d9.png\" />，再连接<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4b13a2af6e6ca7be.png\" />，根据两点之间直线最短求解。如下图：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16acfc1dad54537.png\" /></p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4b13a2af6e6ca7be.png\" />是直角三角形<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1d47dece394f5734.png\" />的斜边，要让斜边最短，则两直角边的平方和要尽可能小。当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-be0c853f740b77e4.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4c7adb4b02db3794.png\" />时，两直角边的平方和最小。</p><p>则所求<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4b13a2af6e6ca7be.png\" />最短<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1d6d8379e935c340.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"}]}]}